@startuml PortfolioGitRepositoryMaster
!theme plain
title 포트폴리오 Git 저장소 전체 구조

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Malgun Gothic
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam PackageBorderColor #444444
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #FAFAFA

actor "개발자 NY" as NY
actor "Codex\n집 작업" as Codex
actor "Claude\n회사 작업" as Claude
actor "면접관 / 방문자" as Recruiter

cloud "GitHub" as GitHub {
  node "md-docs\n문서 원본 저장소" as RemoteDocs
  node "unity-technical-showcase\nUnity 프로젝트 저장소\n나중에 연결" as RemoteUnity
  node "starkshn.github.io\n공개 포트폴리오 사이트" as RemoteSite
}

folder "로컬 PC" as Local {
  package "C:\\kny\\technical-portfolio-docs" as DocsRepo {
    artifact "Markdown 문서" as Markdown
    artifact "PlantUML" as UML
    artifact "GPT / Claude / Codex 전달 문서" as Handoff
    artifact "Notion / Calendar 운영 규칙" as OpsDocs
    artifact "로드맵 / 면접 정리" as InterviewDocs
  }

  package "C:\\kny\\Project\\Unity\\unity-technical-showcase" as UnityRepo {
    artifact "Unity C# 코드" as UnityCode
    artifact "Editor Tool" as EditorTool
    artifact "Scene / Shader / Asset" as UnityAssets
    artifact "테스트 / 실험" as UnityTests
  }

  package "C:\\kny\\starkshn.github.io" as SiteRepo {
    artifact "포트폴리오 페이지" as PortfolioPage
    artifact "블로그 링크" as BlogLinks
    artifact "데모 영상 / GIF 링크" as DemoLinks
  }
}

NY --> DocsRepo : 문서 작성 / 검토
NY --> UnityRepo : Unity 구현
NY --> SiteRepo : 공개 포트폴리오 정리

Codex --> DocsRepo : 구조 설계 / 운영 규칙 / 문서 자동화
Codex --> UnityRepo : 구현 준비 / 코드 작성
Claude --> DocsRepo : 문서 리뷰 / 블로그 초안 / 면접 답변

DocsRepo --> RemoteDocs : push / pull
UnityRepo ..> RemoteUnity : repo 생성 후 remote 연결
SiteRepo --> RemoteSite : push / pull

RemoteDocs --> Claude : 회사에서 clone / pull
RemoteDocs --> Codex : 집에서 pull / save-md
RemoteSite --> Recruiter : 공개 포트폴리오 확인
RemoteUnity --> Recruiter : 코드 리뷰 / 기술 검증

note right of DocsRepo
문서의 Source of Truth
- 설계
- PlantUML
- Notion 운영
- Calendar 규칙
- GPT/Claude/Codex handoff
end note

note right of UnityRepo
실제 구현의 Source of Truth
- C# Runtime
- Editor Tool
- Demo Scene
- Shader
- Optimization
end note

note right of SiteRepo
외부 공개용
- 요약 페이지
- 블로그 연결
- 데모 영상 링크
end note

@enduml
